   "unmapped": [
    "Reward = <theta, z_{t,a}> + f_t(x_t) + xi_t with fixed unknown theta and an action-independent confounding term f_t(x_t) in [-1,1] chosen by an adaptive adversary (semiparametric / partially linear model)",
